  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 213(a) and Reg. 1.213-1(e)(1)(iii), capital improvements for medical purposes are deductible as medical expenses to the extent the cost exceeds the increase in property value. Hoffman spent $20,000 and the improvements added $8,000 in value, so $12,000 qualifies ($20,000 minus $8,000).
